erpieces of art and  cultural heritage and have easy access to the facilities of the National Museum  such as its laboratory, library, storage/reserve collection and technical  support sections for a holistic learning.</p></td>\r\n383-                                          </tr>\r\n384-                                                         \r\n385-                                         \r\n--\n553-</ul>\r\n554-<div style=\"position: relative; background-color: #fff8e1; padding: 15px 15px 20px 15px; border-left: 6px solid red; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #b30000; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n555-<img src=\"https://admission.jmi.ac.in/application/assets/images/Old_blink.gif\" alt=\"Old\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;\">\r\n556:Date - 20.04.2026 &nbsp;- Upcoming Event News - Department of Art Conservation “INDIAN INSTITUTE OF HERITAGE, NOIDA” – ANNOUNCEMENT - Indian Travel Grant for 21st ICOM-Conservation Triennial Conference, Oslo, Norway from 14th - 18th September, 2026<span style=\"position: absolute; right: 20px; bottom: 5px; font-size: 14px;\">\r\n557-  <a href=\"downloads/ITG2026Conservation.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #d9534f; text-decoration: underline;\">\r\n558-    Click here for details\r\n559-  </a>\r\n--\n982-                      <tr>\r\n983-                        <td background=\"images/BottomBg.jpg\"><table width=\"100%\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n984-                          <tr>\r\n985:                            <td width=\"30%\" class=\"bottom_addr\"><span class=\"whitetext\"><strong>NATIONAL MUSEUM INSTITUTE</strong><br>\r\n986-                              of History of Art, Conservation &amp; Museology<br>\r\n987:                              (Deemed to be University)<br>Campus: A-19, Institutional Area, Sector - 62, Noida, Uttar Pradesh – 201309<br>\r\n988-                              Regd. Office: First Floor, National Museum, <br> \r\n989-         